AMENDEDANALYSIS
This bill revises training requirements for critical incident stress management teams and
permits the team leader to designate team members. The bill also clarifies that a team need not be
affiliatedwithamunicipalityandestablishesqualificationsandresponsibilitiesoftheteamleader.

